  "description": "Use this when the user is looking for a property to buy or rent — a home, apartment, plot or commercial space — or asks what is on offer in a place, in a price range or of a given size. Searches real-estate listings published on new.estate in many countries and returns matching listings with price, area, location and the URL of each listing page. The accepted property type and country values are listed by get_catalog. The listing URL is the page to cite for each result. Do not use for publishing a listing; get_publishing_info covers that.",
